          </div>
          <div class="stat-row-card">
            <div class="stat-left">
              <div class="stat-title">Frame Rate Performance</div>
              <div class="stat-description">Silky smooth hardware-accelerated scroll</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-number-badge">60 FPS</div>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row-card">
            <div class="stat-left">
              <div class="stat-title">Average Time to Production</div>
              <div class="stat-description">From idea prompt to downloadable live website</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-number-badge">10 Mins</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="proof-quote">
          "In 2026, flat websites feel like paper brochures. Interactive 3D web is the new baseline for tech brands."
        </div>

      {% elif slide.layout == 'quickstart' %}
        <!-- SLIDE 6: 60-SECOND QUICKSTART -->
        <div class="eyebrow-badge">⚡ {{ slide.eyebrow|default('60-SECOND BLUEPRINT') }}</div>
        <h1 class="slide-headline">{{ slide.headline_html|safe }}</h1>
        <p class="slide-subtext">{{ slide.subtext }}</p>

        <div class="roadmap-list">
          <div class="roadmap-item">
            <div class="roadmap-step-badge">STEP 01</div>
            <div class="roadmap-text">
              <h3>Visit signhify.dpdns.org</h3>
