            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="roadmap-item">
            <div class="roadmap-step-badge">STEP 02</div>
            <div class="roadmap-text">
              <h3>Type Your Vision in Plain English</h3>
              <p>Describe your product, colors, 3D shapes, and the kind of scroll effect you want.</p>
